EDAM ontology data in edam.tsv

edam.tsv holds the class ids, labels and subclass relations of the data, format, operation
and topic branches of EDAM, release 1.25.20260626T1230Z, reduced from the release file
https://github.com/edamontology/edamontology/releases/download/1.25.20260626T1230Z/EDAM.owl
by edam.py. Deprecated classes are left out.

